<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="S4.T3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Evaluation on compositional generation and human preference metrics.</span> We calculate the Preference Scores on samples generated by DPG-Bench prompts.</figcaption>
<div id="S4.T3.4" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:377.6pt;height:34.6pt;vertical-align:-15.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-149.0pt,13.7pt) scale(0.558978618670298,0.558978618670298) ;">
<table id="S4.T3.4.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T3.4.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
